@startuml sequence-tracking
title Живой трекинг — WSS на краю, gRPC stream внутри
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Courier as CR
actor Client as CL
participant "BFF" as BFF
participant "Tracking" as TR
database "Redis\ngeo · pub/sub" as RD
participant "Geo\nHTTPS REST" as GEO

CL -> BFF: WSS /v1/orders/{id}/track
BFF -> TR: gRPC stream Subscribe(order_id)

loop каждые 3–5 с
  CR -> BFF: HTTPS REST\nPUT /v1/courier/location
  BFF -> TR: gRPC ReportLocation
  TR -> RD: GEOADD + PUBLISH
end

RD -> TR: pub/sub
TR --> BFF: stream LocationUpdated
BFF --> CL: WSS JSON {lat, lon, eta}

opt пересчёт ETA (не на каждую точку)
  TR -> GEO: HTTPS REST route/eta
  GEO --> TR: duration
end

@enduml
